---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

import SeoPage from "@/components/SeoPage.astro";

const lastUpdated = "April 12, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <SeoPage
    slot="head"
    title="Terms of Service"
    description="Terms of service for personal tools and integrations operated by Varant Avanesyan."
  />
  <div class="prose dark:prose-invert mt-8 max-w-none">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</em></p>

    <p>
      These terms apply to personal tools, scripts, and integrations operated
      by Varant Avanesyan ("I", "me"). These tools are personal projects
      intended solely for my own use and are not offered as services to the
      public.
    </p>

    <h2>Personal use</h2>
    <p>
      My tools are built and run for my own personal needs. They are not
      products, are not for sale, and do not provide services to third
      parties. No warranty of any kind is offered.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party platforms</h2>
    <p>
      Where my tools interact with third-party platforms (for example,
      TikTok), they do so only against accounts I own and operate, using
      official APIs and in accordance with the relevant platform's developer
      terms and community guidelines.
    </p>

    <h2>No liability</h2>
    <p>
      My personal tools are provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. I
      accept no liability for any damages arising from their use or
      misuse.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      These terms may be updated from time to time. The "last updated" date
      above reflects the most recent revision.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about these terms, contact me through the links on the
      <a href="/">homepage</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
